# Build artifacts. `make build` writes here and `make clean` removes it; the
# binary must never be committed. Until this file existed, dist/ was ignored only
# by a personal global gitignore, so the artifact would have been committed on any
# other machine and in CI.
/dist/

# Go test and coverage output.
*.test
*.out
coverage.txt

# Editor and OS noise.
.DS_Store
*.swp
